#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""cc-meter: live terminal dashboard for global Claude Code usage.

Data sources, each refreshed on its own interval:
  * rate limits (5h / 7d) from the OAuth endpoint behind `/usage`, with the
    token read from the macOS Keychain (or ~/.claude/.credentials.json);
  * throughput, tokens, models, projects and sessions from every transcript
    under ~/.claude/projects, read incrementally (only new bytes per refresh).

State lives in ~/.cache/cc-meter: limit samples (burn rate, forecasts, the
burn heatmap) and a transcript index (file offsets + the last 7 days of
requests), so a restart does not rescan gigabytes of transcripts.

Keys: q quit · ↑↓ j k PgUp PgDn g G / mouse wheel scroll · w cycle chart
window · r refresh · u poll the usage API now
"""

